data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-1", "text": "Drafted 'rb87_sas_1inch_mounted' on a 485x185 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 3x beam dump, 2x pbs, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Rb-87 saturated absorption spectroscopy (780 nm) using 1-inch mounted optics, reproducing Fig. 2a of the PyOpticL paper. An input beam is split by a half-wave plate and PBS to pick off a spectroscopy branch. A 10:90 beam sampler splits the branch in"}

